schema-driven markdown CRUD + FTS + wiki

Usage:
  mdql [command]

Available Commands:
  completion  Generate the autocompletion script for the specified shell
  help        Help about any command
  index       manage search index
  init        scaffold store directories from schema
  lint        audit store for schema/disk drift
  person      manage person
  project     manage project
  schema      schema introspection
  search      full-text search
  tag         manage tags
  wiki        wiki graph queries

Flags:
  -f, --format string   output: table|json|csv|tsv
  -h, --help            help for mdql
      --no-sync         skip stale-index check on open
  -q, --quiet           IDs only
      --root string     store root (default ".")
      --schema string   schema file path (default "./schema.yml")
  -v, --version         version for mdql

Use "mdql [command] --help" for more information about a command.
